      title: "Creative & Code Agents Are Emerging Fast",
      desc: "From hyper-personalized video campaigns to AI-powered code assistants, the frontier is expanding rapidly into multimodal creative and developer productivity.",
      color: C.accentRed,
    },
    {
      num: "05",
      title: "Early Movers Gain Compounding Advantages",
      desc: "With 10× growth in 18 months and still accelerating, organizations that act now build institutional AI capability that compounds over time.",
      color: "9B59B6",
    },
